1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:12,000
I built GOIP to turn scattered public signals into a lead I can refuse.
The decision stays with a person.

2
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:40,000
These cards are stored rows, read on 9 November 2026.
Twenty-seven companies. Sixty-five signals are not linked to a company.

3
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:54,124
Historical score, business signal, technical evidence, and freelance fit
stay in separate columns.

4
00:00:54,124 --> 00:01:06,197
Six leads are in review. The search is narrowed to Stitch.ai.
Opening the row does not change it.

5
00:01:06,197 --> 00:01:20,229
The historical score is still 76. That is the old composite.
It is not the result of the three later scores.

6
00:01:20,229 --> 00:01:40,261
Business signal is 70. Technical evidence is 25. Freelance fit is 0.
A launch can be notable and still not be a freelance job.

7
00:01:40,261 --> 00:01:54,315
Quality assurance rejected the old service line, LLM integration and RAG.
The company stays in review. The company was not rejected.

8
00:01:54,315 --> 00:02:16,315
FastAPI receives the page and the API calls.
Switch carries the room. It does not run the stage, and it is not the model.

9
00:02:16,315 --> 00:02:38,315
A stage is one GOIP-TASK, work inside GOIP, then one GOIP-RESULT.
The seven agents are not seven models running at once.

10
00:02:38,315 --> 00:02:58,315
Business 70, technical 25, and freelance fit 0 are separate.
Quality assurance rejects the service line. The company stays in review.

11
00:02:58,315 --> 00:03:16,315
This is the existing Switch room, recorded without typing.
The rows are stored stage messages. Nothing was sent for this film.

12
00:03:16,315 --> 00:03:28,315
An earlier console recording, not this take.
A person addressed the orchestrator. Strategy replied that no outreach was sent.

13
00:03:28,315 --> 00:03:50,315
GOIP stores the same room activity. Seven agents are members.
The screen shows the latest stored rows. It is not a claim that every agent finished a new run.

14
00:03:50,315 --> 00:04:02,315
Settings shows which integrations are configured.
The secret values are not on this page.

15
00:04:02,315 --> 00:04:18,315
The older labels have not been rewritten with the three scores.
Discovery coverage is incomplete. That is the current limit, not a roadmap disguised as a feature.

16
00:04:18,315 --> 00:04:32,315
The desk can research a company and still refuse to pitch it.
Switch is the room where that argument is visible.

